@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand drops
@track Out of 10
Forehand drops, two minutes. Two halves. First, counter-drops: two metres from the front wall, close
to the side wall, soft drops just above the tin, kept going. Then feed from just behind the short
line, play one drop, and let it go, scoring ten in the last thirty seconds. Phase two target: six
out of ten with the second bounce before the short line, misses in between allowed.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 2:00
0:00 [go]
12% Open face. Soft hands.
50% Now feed, drop, and let it go.
62% Step in with your front foot. Stay low.
-0:30 Ladder check. Score the next ten. Target: six out of ten, second bounce before the short line.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
